{
  "id": "section-charisma-rolls",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Charisma Rolls\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,878,893]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Sometimes, you will be able to use\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,893,928]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "diplomacy and make a deal with\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,928,959]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "intelligent monsters. If this is\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,959,992]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "possible, the monster’s description\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,992,1028]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "will say so. This is called a Charisma\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,1028,1067]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "roll.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,1067,1073]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "To perform a Charisma roll, roll d6\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,1073,1109]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "and add +1 if you have the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,1109,1136]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Charisma Skill, or +2 if you have the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,1136,1174]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Charisma (Expert). If you do not\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,1174,1207]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "have the Skill, you may still roll, but\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,1207,1247]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "with no bonus. If you roll the target\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,1247,1285]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "number or better, the monster will\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,1285,1320]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "react well and the encounter will be\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,1320,1357]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "favorable to you (in the way\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,1357,1386]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "described in the text). However, if\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,1386,1422]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you fail a Charisma roll and the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,1422,1455]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "situation escalates into a combat,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,1455,1490]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you will have a -1 to your first Attack\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,1490,1530]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "roll against that creature.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,1530,1558]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Escape rolls\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,1558,1571]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Sometimes, you will want to run\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,1571,1603]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "away from a monster that is too\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,1603,1635]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "powerful for you to fight. To do so,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,1635,1672]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "perform an Escape roll. Roll d6\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,1672,1704]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "against the monster’s L. Add +1 if\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,1704,1739]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you have the Slippery Skill, or +2 if\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,1739,1777]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0028",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you have Slippery (Expert). It makes\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,1777,1814]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0029",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "no difference whether you are\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,1814,1844]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0030",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "running away from a single\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,1844,1871]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0031",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "opponent or a group of monsters.",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[32,1871,1903]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0032",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If you fail an Escape roll, you do not\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,22,61]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0033",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "manage to run away and you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,61,88]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0034",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "automatically take the monster’s\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,88,121]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0035",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "damage. You also suffer any effects\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,121,157]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0036",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "associated with it (poisoning,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,157,188]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0037",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "infection, etc.). You may try again in\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,188,227]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0038",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the following turn. You may try as\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,227,262]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0039",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "many times as you want, until you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,262,296]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0040",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "die or you manage to Escape.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,296,325]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0041",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "The Escape roll is unnecessary if\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,325,359]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0042",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the monster is Slow. You may\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,359,388]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0043",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "always run away from a Slow\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,388,416]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0044",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "monster, unless the encounter tells\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,416,452]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0045",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you otherwise (for example,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,452,480]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0046",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "because you are trapped in a room\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,480,514]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0047",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "with no exit).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,514,529]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0048",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Some monsters may have\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,529,552]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0049",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "modifiers to the Escape roll\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,552,581]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0050",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "because they are good at catching\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,581,615]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0051",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "fleeing prey!\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,615,629]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0052",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Escaping is not allowed if the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,629,660]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0053",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "encounter description states so.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,660,693]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0054",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If the Escape roll is successful, you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,693,731]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0055",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "move back to any neighboring box\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,731,764]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0056",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "that you have already visited. You\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,764,799]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0057",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "must immediately roll a 1 in 6\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,799,830]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0058",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "chance of a random encounter\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,830,859]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0059",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "there, unless the box you moved to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,859,894]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0060",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "is a Safe House.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,894,911]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0061",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "The monsters remain in the box\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,911,942]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0062",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "from which you escaped. If you visit\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,942,979]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0063",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "that box later, you may attempt a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,979,1013]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0064",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Stealth roll (see below) to avoid that\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,1013,1052]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0065",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "monsters, but if you fail they will\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,1052,1088]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0066",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "attack you with +1 on their L.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,1088,1119]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0067",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Mental Scars and Injuries\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,1119,1145]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0068",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "When you lose Sanity points in any\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,1145,1180]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0069",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "event or encounter, you may\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,1180,1208]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0070",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "prevent that Sanity loss by rolling\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,1208,1244]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0071",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "on the Insanity table. You may do\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,1244,1278]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0072",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "so up to 3 times in the lifetime of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,1278,1314]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0073",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "your character. These Mental Scars\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,1314,1349]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0074",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "are permanent.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,1349,1364]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0075",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Likewise, you may do the same\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,1364,1394]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0076",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "with Life points, negating all\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,1394,1425]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0077",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "damage from a single attack by\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,1425,1456]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0078",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "rolling on the Injury table. You may\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,1456,1493]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0079",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "do so up to 3 times in the lifetime\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,1493,1529]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0080",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "of your character. These physical\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,1529,1563]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0081",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "impairments are permanent.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,1563,1590]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0082",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "When you roll a Mental Scar or\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,1590,1621]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0083",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Injury that you already have, reroll\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,1621,1658]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0084",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "until you select one you do not\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,1658,1690]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-charisma-rolls:p0085",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "have.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[33,1690,1696]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    32,
    33
  ]
}
